sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Browser
  participant Adapter as HTTP Adapter
  participant Kernel as GuildGate Kernel
  participant Session as SessionStore
  participant Policy as PolicyStore
  participant Limit as RateLimitStore
  participant Idem as IdempotencyStore
  participant Lock as LockStore
  participant App as Application execute()
  participant Cache as CacheStore
  participant Outbox as OutboxStore
  participant Audit as AuditStore

  Browser->>Adapter: PATCH + cookie + CSRF + idempotency key
  Adapter->>Kernel: execute(action, request)
  Kernel->>Session: resolve(hash(token))
  Session-->>Kernel: session / missing / rotated
  Kernel->>Kernel: exact origin and CSRF checks
  Kernel->>Kernel: parse input and resolve resource
  Kernel->>Policy: maintenance and block checks
  Policy-->>Kernel: current policy decision
  Kernel->>Limit: atomic hit(action subject)
  Limit-->>Kernel: allowed, remaining, reset
  Kernel->>Kernel: application or Discord authorization
  Kernel->>Idem: begin(key, request hash)
  Idem-->>Kernel: started / replay / conflict / inflight
  Kernel->>Lock: acquire(resource lease)
  Lock-->>Kernel: acquired
  Kernel->>App: execute(context, parsed input, abort signal)
  App-->>Kernel: committed result
  Kernel->>Cache: deleteByTags(tags)
  Kernel->>Outbox: enqueue(event)
  Kernel->>Idem: complete(key, result)
  Kernel->>Audit: write(result and policy version)
  Kernel->>Lock: release(compare token)
  Kernel-->>Adapter: typed result and session metadata
  Adapter-->>Browser: response and optional rotated cookie
